prologue/asy/life/README

The .pdf files here are generated by lifegraphics.asy.  That generation
uses the out/*.life files and life.asy.

The out/*.life files were generated from life.scm, using the shell script
run_life.sh and the .init files.  The file life.scm was originally for
Chicken Scheme, but I expect conversion to Racket would be easy.

2021-Jun-02 JH  I have added the out/*.life files to the git repo so
a person could just use them, without having to generate them.